      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing OCR Provider**\n\nI've decided to use the Google Cloud Vision API for OCR in `extract_text.py`. Now I'm focusing on how to integrate the API calls into the Python script cleanly, ensuring that the chosen provider is clearly identifiable within the code for future maintainability or replacement. I'm thinking of how to handle API keys securely.\n\n\n**Initiating Python Script**\n\nI've begun building the `extract_text.py` file. The initial focus is on setting up the Google Cloud Vision API integration. I'm working to integrate it cleanly. Next, I need to figure out how to add a placeholder for the image path.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789862273905,
          "start": 1789862271953
        },
